{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27184","headline":"咏春风 · 崔涯","name":"咏春风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"动地经天物不伤，高情逸韵住何方。\n扶持燕雀连天去，断送杨花尽日狂。\n遶桂月明过万户，弄帆晴晚渡三湘。\n孤云虽是无心物，借便吹教到帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}